---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';

const LAST_VERIFIED = 'August 27, 2026, 9:06 p.m. PDT';
const CORRECTION_MAILTO =
  'mailto:cassiancreed@cassiancreed.com?subject=Jared%20Bridegan%20case%20status%20correction&body=What%20is%20wrong%3A%0D%0AWhat%20the%20correct%20information%20is%3A%0D%0AOfficial%20record%20or%20source%20link%3A%0D%0A';
---

<Base
  title="Jared Bridegan Case Status — Working Draft"
  description="Working draft of the current, source-linked status of the separate Fernandez Saldana, Gardner, and Tenon proceedings in the Jared Bridegan case."
  noindex
  internalLinksOnly
>
  <article class="status wrap">
    <aside class="release-gate" aria-labelledby="release-gate-title">
      <p class="release-gate__eyebrow">Internal working draft · not released</p>
      <h2 id="release-gate-title">This page is not public-release cleared.</h2>
      <p>
        It asks search engines not to index it and is not linked from the public site. Florida
        counsel review, final iSWEAT 3.8 clearance, and buyer-update fulfillment testing remain
        open. This page does not promise automatic updates, and its status content contains no
        purchase or subscription form.
      </p>
    </aside>

    <header class="status__header">
      <p class="evidence evidence--accent">Case Chess · current status</p>
      <h1>The Jared Bridegan case</h1>
      <p class="status__lede">
        Jared Bridegan was a father, husband, designer, and builder. This page keeps the three
        separate criminal proceedings arising from his February 16, 2022 killing distinct and
        identifies what the public record does—and does not—establish.
      </p>
      <p class="status__verified"><strong>Last verified:</strong> {LAST_VERIFIED}</p>
    </header>

    <section class="status__principle" aria-labelledby="three-cases">
      <h2 id="three-cases">Three defendants, three separate proceedings</h2>
      <p>
        A jury has returned guilty verdicts in Mario Fernandez Saldana's case. Shanna Gardner and
        Henry Tenon have separate pending cases. Both have pleaded not guilty and remain presumed
        innocent. Fernandez Saldana's verdict does not decide either pending case.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="status-card status-card--convicted" aria-labelledby="fernandez-status">
      <div class="status-card__head">
        <div>
          <p class="status-card__label">Convicted · pre-sentencing</p>
          <h2 id="fernandez-status">Mario Fernandez Saldana</h2>
        </div>
        <span class="posture">Verdict entered</span>
      </div>
      <p>
        On August 26, 2026, a Duval County jury found Fernandez Saldana guilty of first-degree
        murder and solicitation to commit a capital felony. Formal sentencing has not occurred.
      </p>
      <dl class="facts">
        <div><dt>Docket</dt><dd>16-2023-CF-002862-AXXX-MA</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Next event</dt><dd>“SENTENCING — TO BE SET” hearing</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Date and time</dt><dd>October 5, 2026, 9:00 a.m. EDT</dd></div>
        <div><dt>What it means</dt><dd>A setting hearing, not formal sentencing</dd></div>
      </dl>
    </section>

    <section class="status-card" aria-labelledby="gardner-status">
      <div class="status-card__head">
        <div>
          <p class="status-card__label">Pending case · presumed innocent</p>
          <h2 id="gardner-status">Shanna Gardner</h2>
        </div>
        <span class="posture">Case pending</span>
      </div>
      <p>
        Gardner has pleaded not guilty. The charges against her remain allegations, and the court
        continued her trial on August 27, 2026.
      </p>
      <dl class="facts">
        <div><dt>Docket</dt><dd>16-2023-CF-002862-BXXX-MA</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Pretrial</dt><dd>October 27, 2026, 9:00 a.m. EDT</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Jury selection</dt><dd>May 3, 2027; time not publicly verified</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Trial window</dt><dd>May 10–28, 2027; time not publicly verified</dd></div>
      </dl>
    </section>

    <section class="status-card" aria-labelledby="tenon-status">
      <div class="status-card__head">
        <div>
          <p class="status-card__label">Pending case · presumed innocent</p>
          <h2 id="tenon-status">Henry Tenon</h2>
        </div>
        <span class="posture">Case pending</span>
      </div>
      <p>
        Tenon withdrew his earlier guilty plea, was re-indicted, and has pleaded not guilty. His
        case is separate from the Fernandez Saldana and Gardner proceedings.
      </p>
      <dl class="facts">
        <div><dt>Docket</dt><dd>16-2023-CF-000888-AXXX-MA</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Pretrial</dt><dd>October 7, 2026, 9:00 a.m. EDT</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Final pretrial</dt><dd>March 22, 2027; time not publicly verified</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Jury-selection/trial window</dt><dd>March 29–April 9, 2027; time not publicly verified</dd></div>
      </dl>
      <p class="status-card__note">
        A proposed May 2027 joinder with Gardner has not been verified as a final court schedule.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="sources" aria-labelledby="sources-title">
      <h2 id="sources-title">Sources and verification limits</h2>
      <p>
        Court schedules can change. This page states a time only when the cited record supports it;
        otherwise it uses “time not publicly verified.” Check the linked court record before relying
        on a date.
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <a href="https://core.duvalclerk.com/CoreCms.aspx?mode=PublicAccess" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            Duval County Clerk of Courts CORE public portal
          </a>
          — Fernandez Saldana and Tenon dockets, consulted August 27, 2026.
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="https://sao4th.com/media/pdppobpr/sao4-press-release-jury-finds-mario-fernandez-saldana-guilty-of-murder-for-hire.pdf" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            Office of the State Attorney, Fourth Judicial Circuit verdict release
          </a>
          — August 26, 2026.
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="https://core.duvalclerk.com/court/case/13705039/docket/235786946/content.pdf" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            Circuit Court order granting Gardner's continuance
          </a>
          — docket entry 851, August 27, 2026.
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="https://apnews.com/article/44f9fdfbb1e23d8e6075ea03d7fd7a35" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            Associated Press verdict report
          </a>
          — August 26, 2026.
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p class="sources__correction">
        See something wrong? <a href={CORRECTION_MAILTO}>Report a correction with the supporting record.</a>
      </p>
    </section>
  </article>
</Base>

<style>
  .status{max-width:900px;padding-top:38px;padding-bottom:64px}
  .release-gate{border:2px solid #ba7a36;background:rgba(186,122,54,.1);border-radius:12px;padding:18px 20px;margin-bottom:38px}
  .release-gate__eyebrow,.status-card__label{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#d39a58;margin:0 0 7px}
  .release-gate h2{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:23px;margin:0 0 8px}
  .release-gate p:last-child{color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.6;margin:0;max-width:74ch}
  .status__header{padding-bottom:28px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
  .status__header h1{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:clamp(38px,7vw,62px);line-height:1;margin:10px 0 16px}
  .status__lede{font-size:18px;line-height:1.65;color:var(--ink-2);max-width:72ch;margin:0}
  .status__verified{font-size:13px;color:var(--ink-3);margin:18px 0 0}
  .status__principle{padding:30px 0 8px}
  .status__principle h2,.sources h2{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:28px;margin:0 0 10px}
  .status__principle p,.sources p,.sources li{color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.65}
  .status-card{background:var(--bg-2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-left:4px solid #7895aa;border-radius:12px;padding:22px;margin-top:20px}
  .status-card--convicted{border-left-color:#5fae7e}
  .status-card__head{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px}
  .status-card h2{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:28px;margin:0}
  .status-card>p{color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.65;max-width:72ch}
  .posture{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;white-space:nowrap;color:var(--ink-2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:999px;padding:6px 9px}
  .facts{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:1px;background:var(--line);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;margin:18px 0 0}
  .facts div{background:var(--bg-3);padding:13px 14px}
  .facts dt{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink-3);margin-bottom:5px}
  .facts dd{font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--ink);margin:0}
  .status-card__note{font-size:13px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:14px;margin-bottom:0}
  .sources{border-top:1px solid var(--line);margin-top:38px;padding-top:30px}
  .sources ul{padding-left:20px}
  .sources li{margin-bottom:10px}
  .sources a{color:var(--accent)}
  .sources__correction{margin-top:22px}
  @media(max-width:680px){
    .status{padding-top:24px}
    .facts{grid-template-columns:1fr}
    .status-card__head{display:block}
    .posture{display:inline-block;margin-top:10px}
  }
</style>
